SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite   0.0  0.1
    Goethite 0.0  0.0
    Gypsum   0.0  0.0

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1.0
    O2(g)  -0.7

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_oxidation.sel
    -reset false
    -solution 1
    -pH true
    -molalities H+
    -totals Fe S(6) Ca
END
